      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To keep up, we built the Performance Factory, an autonomous system that uses the full capabilities of Codex and our models to find and fix regressions at an unprecedented speed.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/index/how-openai-performance-factory-keeps-chatgpt-fast",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T08:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T03:09:53.770Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Performance Factory, which runs in the cloud and automates investigating and resolving performance problems, enables us to keep pace with the ambition of our roadmap.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/index/how-openai-performance-factory-keeps-chatgpt-fast",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T08:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T03:09:53.770Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In the Performance Factory, our engineers define workflows for recurring jobs and write instructions for the Codex agents that carry them out.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/index/how-openai-performance-factory-keeps-chatgpt-fast",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T08:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T03:09:53.770Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "From investigating to authoring the fix to verifying mitigation, this first workflow in the Performance Factory has automated the entire process of fixing regressions.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/index/how-openai-performance-factory-keeps-chatgpt-fast",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T08:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T03:09:53.770Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In just over three months, the Regression Workflow tracked more than 1,700 investigations and root caused over 600 cases.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/index/how-openai-performance-factory-keeps-chatgpt-fast",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T08:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T03:09:53.770Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "That’s 17 automated investigations every day.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/index/how-openai-performance-factory-keeps-chatgpt-fast",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-19T08:00:00.000Z",
